sequenceDiagram
    actor Customer as 客户
    participant UI as Vue显示模块
    participant API as atm.js
    participant Tx as TransactionController
    participant Receipt as ReceiptController
    participant Service as TransactionService
    participant Session as SessionValidator
    participant Mapper as TransactionMapper
    participant DB as 数据库

    Customer->>UI: 查看交易流水
    UI->>API: getTransactionHistory(sessionId,page,size)
    API->>Tx: GET /transactions/history
    Tx->>Service: getTransactionHistory
    Service->>Session: 校验 sessionId
    Session-->>Service: cardNo
    Service->>Mapper: selectByAccountIdPaged
    Mapper->>DB: 查询当前账户流水
    DB-->>Mapper: records,total
    Mapper-->>Service: 流水数据
    Service-->>UI: 分页流水
    Customer->>UI: 选择单笔凭条
    UI->>API: getReceipt(transactionId,sessionId)
    API->>Receipt: GET /receipts/{transactionId}
    Receipt->>Service: getReceipt
    Service->>Session: 校验当前会话账户
    Service->>Mapper: selectByTransactionId
    Mapper->>DB: 查询单笔交易
    DB-->>Mapper: transaction
    Service-->>UI: 凭条信息
